    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1137">

                <pb facs="1159" n="1149" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1149"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/10–1649: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McConaughy</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-10-16">October 16,
                        1949</date>.<lb/>[Received October 15—11:58 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4353. Further ConGen unnumbered telegram October 16 [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >15?</hi>]. Radio message from Master [of] Isbrandtsen SS <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Flying Trader</hi> just received by local agent and
                    indicates ship released at 0920 local time and is proceeding Taku Bar. ConGen
                    endeavoring to ascertain details.</p>
                <pb facs="1160" n="1150" xml:id="pg1150"/>
                <p>Sent Department 4353; repeated Embassy Chungking unnumbered, Hong Kong 315,
                    Taipei 378.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
